<html>
    <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Odyra Safaris</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; width:100%; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#1f2933;">
            <div style="display: block;">
                <p>Hi <%= admin %>,</p>
                <p>A new customer has registered with Odyra Safaris.</p>
                <p style="font-weight: 600;">Customer details: </p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 600;">Name:</span> <%= name %></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 600;">Email:</span> <%= email %></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 600;">Phone:</span> <%= phone %></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 600;">Registered On:</span> <%= date %></p>

               <p>The customer account has been successfully created and is now available in the Odyra Safaris dashboard.</p>
               
               <p>Best Wishes</p>
               <p style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;">The Odyra Safaris Team.</p>
            </div>
</body>
</html>